window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>With the final battle looming, the fate of humanity will be decided. Alex Keener and Elekim will face down Askala, the dark Radaskim Xenomind.</p> <p>But as Askala unleashes her final fury, the road to Ragnarok can only be paved with grit...and lives.</p> <p>In this explosive conclusion to the Wasteland Chronicles series, Alex will rise to the mantle as Elekim...but will it be enough to defeat Askala?</p>"; 
